3686
01:51:22,480 --> 01:51:23,214
See you tomorrow.

3687
01:51:23,440 --> 01:51:24,840
Good night.

3688
01:51:24,840 --> 01:51:25,560
Good night.

3689
01:51:25,560 --> 01:51:26,400
Good work.

3690
01:51:26,800 --> 01:51:27,880
Without today,

3691
01:51:27,880 --> 01:51:28,720
