Stop it.

3704
01:52:04,920 --> 01:52:06,400
Whoever I touch sings.

3705
01:52:06,520 --> 01:52:07,920
The heavens spare no one.

3706
01:52:09,240 --> 01:52:11,200
It's like the sea rushed towards me.

3707
01:52:11,200 --> 01:52:12,520
I just felt like

3708
01:52:12,520 --> 01:52:14,000
it was like a tsunami.

3709
01:52:14,000 --> 01:52:16,400
Wow, the world is really fresh.

3710
01:52:16,960 --> 01:52:18,920
